{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15887","headline":"送司空十四北游宋州 · 张南史","name":"送司空十四北游宋州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"九拒危城下，萧条送尔归。\n寒风吹画角，暮雪犯征衣。\n道里犹成间，亲朋重与违。\n白云愁欲断，看入大梁飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张南史","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15887.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15887","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}